{
  "note": "Track A: the model drives the SAM harness through pi (non-interactive). Expected values come from the reference run output/bench/reference (2026-10-28): lambdaGC 1.0464, 164 significant variants, 14 loci, LDSC h2 0.2647 (SE 0.0781, z 3.39), intercept 1.0224, 4 credible sets at locus 2, PRS weight match 19.1% (184,705 of 966,764).",
